-- PointSets: Table: PointSets. A finite configuration P ⊂ R^2. Aggregations count membership and unit-distance pairs; calculated fields derive density and exponent estimates. The Erdős unit-distance question lives on this table — 'how many unit pairs can n points have?' is literally `UnitDistancePairCount` for varying `PointCount`.
