-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- NumberFields: Table: NumberFields. A finite extension K of Q. Discriminant, degree, class number, and signature are raw inputs — but IsTotallyReal, IsTotallyComplex, and SatisfiesGolodShafarevich are first-class calculated booleans on the same row, not separate property rows.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
