-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- MinkowskiLattices: Table: MinkowskiLattices. The image of O_K under the Minkowski embedding into R^(r_1 + 2*r_2). Carries Gram matrix as raw JSON (matrix algebra is not in scope for ERB formulas), but everything derivable from already-promoted quantities — Dimension, the determinant-equals-discriminant identity check — is a first-class field.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
