-- Metrics: Table: Metrics. First-class distance functions on a space. The Euclidean metric on R^2, the Gram-matrix-induced metric on a lattice, and non-metric similarity functions all live here as named rows. Downstream tables that 'use a distance' should point at a Metrics row rather than hard-coding the formula.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
